# 🧠 LEADER: Large Language Model Enhanced Medication Recommendation

---

## 📌 Overview

> **LEADER** is a novel framework for EHR-based medication recommendation that improves both **accuracy** and **interpretability**.
>
> It addresses two critical challenges:
> - ❌ Lack of **molecular drug knowledge integration**
> - ❌ Poor modeling of **hierarchical medication taxonomy**
>
> ✅ Our solution:
> - Hierarchical ATC prediction (L1 → L4)
> - Cross-attention drug knowledge fusion
> - Robust imbalance handling strategy

---

## 🏗️ Framework

> ![Framework](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/framework-placeholder.png)

---

## 🧩 Key Components

> ### 1️⃣ Hierarchical Prediction Head
> - Multi-level ATC prediction: **L1 → L2 → L3 → L4**
> - Enforces **hierarchical consistency**

---

> ### 2️⃣ Cross-Attention Drug Knowledge Module
> - Integrates **molecular drug embeddings**
> - Enhances **drug-specific representation**

---

> ### 3️⃣ 4-Layer Defense Strategy
> Handles severe class imbalance:
> - Focal Loss  
> - Class Weights  
> - Threshold Optimization  
> - Hierarchical Consistency Loss  

---

## 📂 Data Format

> All datasets are in **JSONL format** (one sample per line)  
> Source: **MIMIC-III**

---

> ### 📄 Sample
```json
{
  "input": "Clinical narrative...",
  "target": "medications...",
  "subject_id": 12345,
  "atc_level_1": ["A", "C"],
  "atc_level_2": ["A1", "C0"],
  "atc_level_3": ["A10", "C07"],
  "atc_level_4": ["A10A", "C07A"]
}
